{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap, dash, and vault through an endless adrenaline rush!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform Vault is a <strong>high-stakes infinite runner</strong> where hesitation means disaster. Every jump is permanent\u00a0<strong>no turning back</strong>\u00a0as platforms shift, and crumble beneath you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> - Test your endurance in an ever-accelerating gauntlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack</strong> - Race against the clock in a blistering sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Mode</strong> - Wild, unpredictable platforms for maximum chaos</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>new character</strong> and <strong>cosmetics</strong> with in-run gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated <strong>platforms with unique behaviors</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge Yourself</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on <strong>global leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Down But Not Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857410/832b76b23e9e6a6fddcbec032fc4e0b84364527a.jpg"},{"name":"If At First You Don't Succeed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857410/3fb43e78f7b08d98c2ff7526c15bb8f487558e3e.jpg"},{"name":"Things Change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857410/86c5b9a2fc4cfea45181a67361ec5a96b9f56aae.jpg"},{"name":"A Full Deck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3857410/9e2623d348951dfbceff76a3086ef256